+	/*
+	 * Lens shading: each colour is multiplied by 1 + k1 r^2 + k2 r^4,
+	 * where r^2 = dot(p * p, lscScale) for p, the position from the
+	 * centre of the input in fractions of its size. The GPU debayer
+	 * applies it.
+	 */
